le.com/store/apps/details?id=com.YoStarJP.AzurLane</a><br />\r\n■iOS<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/jp/app/id1242186587\" target=\"_blank\">https://apps.apple.com/jp/app/id1242186587</a>"}]},{"type":"text","title":"クレジット","body":[{"intro":"声優：阿部里果<br />\r\n<br />\r\nイラスト：葵井ちづる<br />\r\n<br />\r\nシナリオ：Yostar<br />\r\n<br />\r\n制作協力:青春×フェティシズム<br />\r\n&lt; <a href=\"https://twitter.com/aohachannel\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/aohachannel</a> &gt;<br />\r\n<br />\r\n制作：アトリエメール<br />\r\n&lt; <a href=\"https://twitter.com/AtelierMerChan\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/AtelierMerChan</a> &gt;"}]}],"description":"「…ところで指揮官、このあと時間はありますか？」","short_introduction":"「…ところで指揮官、このあと時間はありますか？」","options":["SND","TRI","DLP","REV","OLY","ipVoiceWork"],"url":"https://www.dlsite.com/maniax/work/=/product_id/RJ01158544.html","site_id":"home","fetched_at":1795515040}